{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "a",
  "task": "t119",
  "chunk": "a/036",
  "family": "NOR10"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u08682",
   "en": "No. I see a strong, passionate man. With a great ass.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08683",
   "en": "There are regs against this, you know. You ready to deal with the consequences?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08684",
   "en": "Trying a frontal assault? All that training, you'd think they'd teach you the best approach is indirect. To draw the enemy out of their fixed defenses.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08685",
   "en": "Is that an admission of something, Shepard? I have a better idea. How about I lead?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08686",
   "en": "I've spent my whole life fighting to get what I want. To get it done, I had to bury a lot of things.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08687",
   "en": "During that whole time, not even once did I feel like I was worth what I was fighting for.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08688",
   "en": "You make me feel good enough.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08689",
   "en": "Mm. No, I think you'll have to come here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08690",
   "en": "This isn't an act, Shepard. But you'll learn.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08691",
   "en": "I don't think of you as one. But I won't be all squishy and submissive either. This is going to be a give-and-take. I'll show you what I mean.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08692",
   "en": "You're worried about the crew, aren't you? All right. We'll put a pin in it. Just so they don't get all jealous.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08693",
   "en": "After, though--assuming we don't get the firing squad--I'm going to blow your mind.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08694",
   "en": "Guess I'll head back to my bunk and find something to entertain myself. Sleep tight, Shepard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08695",
   "en": "Oh, before I go. We saw Kaidan in a news vid about the Normandy. He's cute. Later, sis.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08696",
   "en": "Let's pretend this never happened.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08697",
   "en": "Of course not, sir. Fraternization is against regulations.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08698",
   "en": "No, ma'am. And anyway, scuttlebutt says he's already sweet on someone.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08699",
   "en": "Fraternization is against regulations, ma'am. Don't ask, don't tell.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08700",
   "en": "Sure, if you have time. Figured you'd be busy with tactical briefings and whatnot.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08701",
   "en": "I'm off duty until tomorrow. I was going to have a small drink. Bit of a celebration. If you're interested.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08702",
   "en": "Can't say I'm better. Sorry for anything I said back there. I just-- I don't want any deaths on my hands. And it's my fault.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08703",
   "en": "I know. If we hadn't gotten pinned down, you would have been there to help him.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08704",
   "en": "It's funny. I don't have any fear of dying for the Alliance. But when I think of someone dying for me--",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08705",
   "en": "Uh, if you don't mind my asking, how did you deal with the losses on Akuze?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08706",
   "en": "I could never do that. Not before, and definitely not now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08707",
   "en": "I have to be worth Kaidan's life.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08708",
   "en": "Yeah. A good guy like him must be with God now, huh? So nothing to be sad about. He must be happier.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08709",
   "en": "Thanks for the advice, skipper.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08710",
   "en": "Thanks for the advice, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08711",
   "en": "We lost a lot of the colonists. I don't see how we could have done more, but I still feel bad about it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08712",
   "en": "You all right? That must've been like what you saw on Elysium.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08713",
   "en": "I didn't think of that. I'm sorry.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08714",
   "en": "Amen, skipper.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08715",
   "en": "Amen, sir.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08716",
   "en": "Amen, ma'am.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08717",
   "en": "I mean, we are out here to protect them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08718",
   "en": "I think those people will probably be happier someplace else.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08719",
   "en": "I can't figure why anyone would live groundside if they didn't get grass and blue skies.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08720",
   "en": "Gotta admire those colonials. That's about the worst place for a colony I've ever seen.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08721",
   "en": "Given the option, I'd get the hell out of Dodge.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08722",
   "en": "A little spooky how you handled that Jeong guy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08723",
   "en": "Didn't figure you'd know how to speak corporate.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08724",
   "en": "You make it sound easy. Frankly, I just wanted to put a few rounds in him and leave.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08725",
   "en": "That would be a waste of a fine ass, sir.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08726",
   "en": "Painful. Think I'll leave that to you. No offense.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08727",
   "en": "Remind me never to play poker with you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08728",
   "en": "Like I said, the rachni are dangerous. They proved that two thousand years ago.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08729",
   "en": "I think it was a mistake to let them go. But that wasn't my call to make. It was yours.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08730",
   "en": "Like I said, killing a whole race isn't something I want on my conscience.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08731",
   "en": "You made the right decision, skipper.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08732",
   "en": "You made the right decision, sir.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08733",
   "en": "You made the right decision, ma'am.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08734",
   "en": "I think wiping them out was a mistake. But that wasn't my call to make. It was yours.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08735",
   "en": "You know, you really should talk to T'Soni about her mom. She has to be hurting.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08736",
   "en": "If you haven't talked to Dr. T'Soni, you probably should. She just lost her mom. That has to hurt.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08737",
   "en": "You know, when we pick up that asari scientist, we'll have to tell her we killed her mom. That's going to suck.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08738",
   "en": "Just saying, skipper.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08739",
   "en": "Just saying, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08740",
   "en": "They were dangerous, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08741",
   "en": "You don't have to call me that. I'm a traitor now. I probably shouldn't even be wearing this uniform.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08742",
   "en": "For now. The Alliance has to catch me before they can strip my rank.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08743",
   "en": "Don't start with the poetry crap again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08744",
   "en": "As I recall, the captain dies in that poem.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08745",
   "en": "First Alfred Tennyson, now Walt Whitman? You're full of surprises.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08746",
   "en": "Just a few months ago, you would have.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08747",
   "en": "They can say whatever the hell they want. Everyone on this ship knows the truth.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08748",
   "en": "If the Alliance calls us rogues, we won't set back the diplomacy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08749",
   "en": "We wouldn't have been assigned to this ship if we weren't. We'll get it done.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08750",
   "en": "Is my rank all you see when you look at me?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08751",
   "en": "It occurs to me that this might be our last night alive. Got any plans?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08752",
   "en": "Ash, I don't always want to lead you. Sometimes I'd like to stand beside you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08753",
   "en": "Bunk here tonight, Ash. With me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08754",
   "en": "This isn't a contest, Ash.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08755",
   "en": "I'm not looking to be a toy, Ash.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08756",
   "en": "Ash, I'd like nothing more than to be with you now. But with everything that's going on--",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08757",
   "en": "The damage is done, Williams.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08758",
   "en": "Are you interested in the lieutenant, Chief?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08759",
   "en": "I heard it. I don't need to tell you it's inappropriate to gossip about how \"cute\" your superior officers are.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08760",
   "en": "Williams, listen to me. I'm in command of this mission. I made the call. Not you. He's dead because of me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08761",
   "en": "Every one of us is expendable if it accomplishes the mission. Alenko. You. Me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08762",
   "en": "I don't like losing people either.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08763",
   "en": "It was my job to get everyone out safe. I failed. I vowed not to let that happen again. Same here. I'll remember him, and I'll do better for him.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08764",
   "en": "We accept death when we put on the uniform, Chief. If you can't deal with that, retire.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08765",
   "en": "I didn't stop and agonize over it while everyone else was in danger. We've got work to do, Williams. We'll remember him later.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08766",
   "en": "Elysium was worse. They had children there.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08767",
   "en": "Some of them lived. Given what happened there, I'd call that a win.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08768",
   "en": "We did the best we could. Not that it means much to the dead.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08769",
   "en": "All you need to do is show them how getting what you want gets them what they want.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08770",
   "en": "All you do is shove a stick up your ass and care more about money than people.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08771",
   "en": "I was making it up as I went along. Every day, this mission teaches me new skills.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08772",
   "en": "I'm not your commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08773",
   "en": "Still calling me that?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08774",
   "en": "Lay off the poems.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08775",
   "en": "Poor choice of quotes.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08776",
   "en": "Whitman?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08777",
   "en": "That's a change.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08778",
   "en": "Me neither.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08779",
   "en": "Are we?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08780",
   "en": "Is that all you see?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08781",
   "en": "Then follow me to my bunk.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08782",
   "en": "Drop the \"Captain\" stuff.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08783",
   "en": "Good enough is just a start.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08784",
   "en": "This isn't the right time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08785",
   "en": "Get over here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08786",
   "en": "I'm not a toy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08787",
   "en": "\"Kaidan,\" hm?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08788",
   "en": "It's not your fault.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08789",
   "en": "We saved some.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08790",
   "en": "They're only human.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08791",
   "en": "It's pretty easy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08792",
   "en": "Ma'am! No, ma'am!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08793",
   "en": "No, ma'am! That's patriotism.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08794",
   "en": "No, ma'am.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08795",
   "en": "Mainly I've been groundside. Part of the surface garrison forces.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08796",
   "en": "I-- No, ma'am!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08797",
   "en": "Sarah got herself a boyfriend who wanted to go faster than she did. Mike.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08798",
   "en": "I didn't think he was a bad kid. Just pushy. Lynn would send me these worried vid-mails, and I'd tell her to relax.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08799",
   "en": "I was on active duty. Sarah's graduating high school this year. This was only a couple years back.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08800",
   "en": "They have their uses, ma'am. Not all of them keep their brains in their pants.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08801",
   "en": "Bold words, Shepard. I like bold.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08802",
   "en": "You've only scratched the surface. Scratch a little deeper.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08803",
   "en": "Sounds like a story. Feel like sharing?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08804",
   "en": "Where were you when this was going on?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08805",
   "en": "You ask me, boys need a cold shower that lasts from age 12 to 25.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08806",
   "en": "Sounds like that situation didn't last.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08807",
   "en": "At this point, I think I know fairly well what you like.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08808",
   "en": "Vid-mails?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08809",
   "en": "Boys... no control.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08810",
   "en": "Something changed?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08811",
   "en": "Thought so.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08812",
   "en": "Yeah. 'Course, if he didn't ask at all, I'd wonder if he thought Sarah was ugly. Damned if you do, damned if you don't.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08813",
   "en": "They were on Amaterasu. At the time, I was assigned to Czarnobóg. Same cluster, but a dozen LY away.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08814",
   "en": "Close enough to talk regularly, too far to make it back in an emergency. I couldn't afford a fast-packet flight.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08815",
   "en": "They're going to keep their jeans on around my sisters. Unless they want to get up close and personal with pruning shears.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08816",
   "en": "Mike thought they'd go for a romantic walk in the woods. 'Cause he figured it was past time they did the deed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08817",
   "en": "She levered Mike face-first into a tree and left. Didn't have a scratch on her. Good thing Mom and Dad had us all learn some kind of self-defense.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08818",
   "en": "I took emergency leave and walked Sar to school for a few days.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08819",
   "en": "It was only a dozen light years. Like a day's cruise. It's not like I was going to Earth or something.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08820",
   "en": "Lynn did pistol practice, but didn't like it. She's kind of nervous. Sar took to aikido.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08821",
   "en": "Abby decided to learn the sword. She always was a little weird. Likes big skirts and tops you have to tie her into.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08822",
   "en": "They do great things to her figure, though...",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08823",
   "en": "One of Dad's friends taught me marine hand-to-hand.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08824",
   "en": "She said it wouldn't solve the real problem. And she and Mike would both become household names. It was a small colony.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08825",
   "en": "I said it was her call to make. That we should let her do it her way. Mom was pretty pissed about that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08826",
   "en": "Embarrassed the hell out of her. But it was worth it in the end.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08827",
   "en": "My last day out, Mike was waiting for us. Sar had told her friends, so everyone at school knew what he did. He wasn't happy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08828",
   "en": "I wanted to snap him in half. But Sar gave me this look. This \"let me handle it, I need to do this alone\" look.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08829",
   "en": "She kept her cool--God bless her--as he screamed in her face. She just let him vent. Then he tried to punch her.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08830",
   "en": "I swear, she just flowed around him. Next thing I know, he's face-down on the sidewalk, and there's blood everywhere.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08831",
   "en": "Better. I'm more or less a straight-up puncher.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  }
 ]
}
